EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Admission Services recently received an application fee waiver from your school. However, I do not see an application for admission to Arizona State University on file for you.

Please submit your application as soon as possible at http://asu.edu/apply. When asked to pay the application fee, select the Pay Later option. Your waiver will then be applied to your application.

If you haven't applied to ASU yet because you are undecided about your major, use our degree search tool to search for a major based on your favorite subject, career interests or keywords at http://asu.edu/degrees. If you are still undecided, choose one of our Exploratory programs.

Let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
